=== REASONING ===

### charging-curve.json — Panel 1 (fn_charging_rate_vs_soc)
Old: Called fn_charging_rate_vs_soc which queried charge_telemetry_readings for battery_level and power_kw.
New: CTE-based query on signal_log. Gets last 5 charging sessions, joins BatteryLevel +
     ACChargingPower/DCChargingPower from signal_log within each session's time window.
     Uses time_bucket('1 minute') to align SOC and power readings into matching rows.
     Pivots signals via CASE WHEN. Filters out rows where SOC is NULL.

### charging-curve.json — Panel 2 (fn_charging_temperature)
Old: Called fn_charging_temperature which queried charge_telemetry_readings for battery_temp/outside_temp.
New: Inline query on signal_log for ModuleTempMax and OutsideTemp during the selected session.
     Uses time_bucket('1 minute') to align temperature readings. JOINs charging_sessions
     to get time window (start_ts to end_ts).

### charging-curve.json — Template variable (session_id)
Old: Referenced start_date in definition and query.
New: Changed to start_ts to match 000142 schema.

### charging-heatmap.json — Panel 1 (fn_charging_calendar_heatmap)
Old: Called fn_charging_calendar_heatmap which grouped by DATE_TRUNC('day', cs.start_date).
New: Inline query on charging_sessions, DATE_TRUNC('day', cs.start_ts), COUNT(*).
     Time-filtered with $__timeFrom/$__timeTo.

### charging-heatmap.json — Panel 2 (fn_charging_weekday_distribution)
Old: Called fn_charging_weekday_distribution. Used cs.start_date and cs.charge_energy_added.
New: Inline query on charging_sessions. Uses start_ts. Uses energy_added_kwh (correct column
     per 000142 schema — old fn used charge_energy_added which was pre-142 schema).

=== CHANGES ===
1. charging-curve.json Panel 1 rawSql: Replaced fn_charging_rate_vs_soc call with inline
   CTE query against signal_log (BatteryLevel, ACChargingPower, DCChargingPower).
   Also fixed start_date → start_ts in the Session label.

2. charging-curve.json Panel 2 rawSql: Replaced fn_charging_temperature call with inline
   signal_log query for ModuleTempMax + OutsideTemp during session time window.

3. charging-curve.json template var session_id: Fixed start_date → start_ts in both
   definition and query fields.

4. charging-heatmap.json Panel 1 rawSql: Replaced fn_charging_calendar_heatmap call with
   inline charging_sessions query grouped by DATE_TRUNC('day', start_ts).

5. charging-heatmap.json Panel 2 rawSql: Replaced fn_charging_weekday_distribution call
   with inline charging_sessions query. Fixed column charge_energy_added → energy_added_kwh.

